SCOPE CORRECTION, DISCLOSED
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Check 3 was first written over every digit in the file and FAILED, first divergence
'18' -> '04'. Those are the digits inside the rewritten sentence — 'Q-18' became
'04 §2.4.2'. The check was comparing document cross-references as if they were
measurements; its scope was wrong, not the artifact. It was corrected to the
measurement-bearing scope and re-run, and the failure is recorded here rather than
quietly dropped: a check that is narrowed after it fails has to show its working,
or narrowing it is indistinguishable from evading it.

